    "solution_hi": "<p style=\"\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">यहाँ अनुसरित&nbsp;तर्क है: -</font></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">दूसरी संख्या = पहली संख्या &times; 2</font></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">तीसरी संख्या = पहली संख्या</font><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">2</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">1)&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">(15, 30, 225) &rarr; (15, 15 &times; 2, 15&nbsp;</font><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">2</font></span><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;) = (15, 30, 225)</font></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">2)&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">(17, 34,&nbsp;</font></font><u><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">278</font></font></u><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;) &rarr; (17, 17 &times; 2, 17&nbsp;</font></font><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">2</font></font></span><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;) = (17, 34,&nbsp;</font></font><u><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">289</font></font></u><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;)</font></font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">3)&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">(12, 24, 144) &rarr; (12, 12 &times; 2, 12&nbsp;</font><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">2</font></span><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;) = (12, 24, 144)</font></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">4)&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">(13, 26, 169) &rarr; (13, 13 &times; 2, 13&nbsp;</font><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">2</font></span><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;) = (13, 26, 169)</font></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">यहाँ, (17, 34, 278) अन्य तीन विकल्पों से भिन्न है।</font></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">अतः,&nbsp;सही उत्तर&nbsp;</font><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&quot;(17, 34, 278)&quot; </span><span style=\"\">है।</span></p>\n",
