  {
    "question": "<span style=\"\">The second number in the given number-pairs is obtained by performing certain&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">mathematical operation(s) on the first number. The same operation(s) is/are followed&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">in all the number-pairs, except one. Find that odd number-pair.</span>",
    "question_hi": "दिए गए संख्या-युग्मों में दूसरी संख्या, पहली संख्या पर कुछ गणितीय संक्रिया(एँ) करके प्राप्त की जाती है। एक को छोड़कर सभी संख्या-युग्मों में एक ही संक्रिया(ओं) का अनुसरण किया जाता है। वह विषम संख्या-युग्म ज्ञात कीजिए।",
    "options": [
      "48&nbsp;∶ 7",
      "25&nbsp;∶ 8",
      "15&nbsp;∶ 4",
      "8&nbsp;∶ 3",
      "Question Not Attempted"
    ],
    "options_hi": [
      "<span style=\"\">48&nbsp;∶ 7</span>",
      "<span style=\"\">25&nbsp;∶ 8</span>",
      "<span style=\"\">15&nbsp;∶ 4</span>",
      "<span style=\"\">8&nbsp;∶ 3</span>",
      "अनुत्तरित प्रश्न"
    ],
    "correct": 2,
    "solution": "",
    "solution_hi": "<p style=\"\">दिए गए विकल्पों में अनुसरण किया गया <span style=\"\">पैटर्न&nbsp;</span>इस प्रकार&nbsp;है:<br />\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&radic;(पहला पद&nbsp;+ 1) =&nbsp;दूसरा पद&nbsp;</span></span><br />\nविकल्पों में <span style=\"\">पैटर्न&nbsp;</span>को&nbsp;लागू करके:<br />\n<span style=\"\">विकल्प&nbsp;<span style=\"\">1)&nbsp;</span></span>48&nbsp;∶ 7<br />\n&nbsp;&radic;(<u><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">48 + 1</span></u>) = 7<br />\n&nbsp;&radic;49 = 7<br />\n&nbsp;7 = 7</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">विकल्प 2)&nbsp;25&nbsp;∶ 8<br />\n&nbsp;&radic;(<u><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">25</span></u><u><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;+ 1</span></u>) = 8<br />\n&nbsp;&radic;26&nbsp;= 8<br />\n&nbsp;5.09&nbsp;&ne;&nbsp;8</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">विकल्प&nbsp;</span>3)&nbsp;15&nbsp;∶ 4<br />\n&nbsp;&radic;(<u><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">15&nbsp;+ 1</span></u>) = 4<br />\n&nbsp;&radic;16&nbsp;= 4<br />\n&nbsp;4&nbsp;= 4</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">विकल्प&nbsp;</span>4)&nbsp;8&nbsp;∶ 3<br />\n&nbsp;&radic;(<u><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">8 + 1</span></u>) = 3<br />\n&nbsp;&radic;9 = 3<br />\n&nbsp;3&nbsp;= 3<br />\nइसलिए,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">25:8 विषम है</span><span style=\"\">।&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">अतः,<strong> सही उत्तर विकल्प 2 है<span style=\"\">।&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n",
    "marks": "0.97"
  },
